flowchart LR
  SRC[POS and app raw rows] --> LAND[Encrypted landing]
  LAND --> CLEAN[Standardize dates and values]
  CLEAN --> MATCH[Customer matching]
  MATCH --> FACT[Fact sales]
  FACT --> MEASURE[Monthly active customers]
  MEASURE --> MODEL[Semantic model]
  MODEL --> DASH[Dashboard KPI]
  RULE[Exclude voids and returns] -. governs .-> MEASURE
